    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>Your whole body, including all limbs and the head, transforms into that of a beast. If some parts of your body already have mutated the GM decides if they change or not. Roll on the @Table[bestial-body]{Bestial Body} Table to see which type of beast that lends its features to you. You can only receive this mutation once.</p>"
    },
